    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "The Gloria family’s new tutors are assigning homework-in subjects that aren’t taught in most schools for young ladies of good breeding. However, despite the eager minds and bodies before them, things are looking grim for the teachers. Someone is out to ruin the family and they don’t care who gets caught in the crossfire. And when a field trip ends in a fight for survival, it becomes obvious that someone wants school to be out permanently!",
        "jpn": "グロリア家の新しい家庭教師は、育ちの良い若い女性のために、ほとんどの学校では教えられない宿題を課しています。"
    },
